PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: chart samples come from the panel's own 1 s clock.
Why: a sample was only appended when a state event arrived; a missed second vanished from the chart and the time axis compressed.
- sampleHist(): tick() samples the last state every second (holds the last value); no samples when the agent is silent > 5 s (as before).
- Numbers and the new chart sample are painted in the same frame (1 frame per second, not 2).
Measured: events cut for 2.5 s inside 10 s -> 8 samples before, 10 after.

